WEBVTT

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.840
Wha...

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.280
You're kidding...!

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:22.290
H...

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:22.850
Hey!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:24.220
Be...

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.380
Be careful, Polnareff!

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.290
Even the slightest wound...

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.090
will end up like this!

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.130
Are you still alive?

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.600
Such a stubborn man.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.060
No moron would get himself killed...

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:46.000
by his own Stand.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:20.100
Just a little scratch is all it takes.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.810
Then my Stand will kill you off.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:45.330
What will you do now...Polnareff?

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:51.860
Run!

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.060
Oh, man...

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.530
This is the toilet!

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:24.330
<i>Somehow...</i>

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:26.960
<i> I always find myself being </i>
<i> attacked in places like toilets... </i>

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.400
<i> Damn it...! </i>

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.130
<i> What a dirty bowl! </i>

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.800
<i> They're searching... </i>

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.630
<i> It's just a matter of time </i>
<i> before they find me... </i>

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.860
<i> Alright then, I'll fight! </i>

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:08.940
<i> Ready when you are! </i>

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.240
<i> I'll chop you to pieces! </i>

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:32.730
<i> What's wrong? </i>

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.270
<i> Why aren't they attacking? </i>

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.290
<i> Do something! </i>

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.030
Damn!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:38.530
Sucker.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.040
Laugh!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:49.940
Shit!

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.110
Chariot!

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:01.480
Is...

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:02.920
Is this it?

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:04.920
Her Stand!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.500
How pathetic, Polnareff.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.230
Let's see what you can do for me.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:19.500
Ah, why don't you start
with that dirty toilet bowl...

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:23.140
by licking it clean.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:25.010
Laugh!

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:54.100
Sorry, but...

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:57.240
I'm looking for a French
guy called Polnareff.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:58.940
Have you seen him?

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:05.480
Well?

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:06.590
Ah...

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.020
Mr. Polnareff?

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:11.680
Mr. Polnareff is in the restroom...

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.990
The restroom...?

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.620
Yes.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:19.060
The restroom is through that door,
then the next door on your right.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.670
The restroom is...through
this door and to the right?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:23.630
Yes...

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.200
<i> It's Jotaro. </i>

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.870
<i> Not good! Don't come in here! </i>

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.380
<i> Please don't come in here! </i>

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.910
<i> This is a trap! </i>

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.020
By the way...

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.790
how do you know Polnareff?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.630
Ahhh...!

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:59.800
Earlier, there was a drunk who
wouldn't stop bothering me...

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:02.640
and he came to my rescue.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.040
Mr. Jotaro...

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:05.940
I see...

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.560
Let me ask you one more thing.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:26.290
You just called me "Jotaro..."

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.030
how do you know my name?

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.540
From...Mr. Polnareff...

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:34.330
That can't be.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:37.000
I told everyone not to mention my name.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.500
Naturally, that includes Polnareff, too...

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:42.680
My dearest son...

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:47.190
J.Gail's killer was to be rid of first...

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.420
It can't be helped.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.160
Son...?

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:52.960
DIE!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.800
Now I get it.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.400
Aren't you worried?

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.500
Don't you wonder about...

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:45.240
how the other guys are
doing while you're here?

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:49.810
Kakyoin!

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:50.880
It's me.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:55.150
I can't seem to find Jotaro anywhere.
Do you know where he is?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:58.690
Just a moment...

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.560
I'm opening it right now...

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:06.060
Joestar-san...

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:10.640
The enemy!

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:15.400
Ah...

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.340
Everyone, there's nothing to....

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:23.180
What are they?

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:24.070
Joestar-san!

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:28.320
He's that guy who was on the street...

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:31.390
It can't be...!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.760
Are they dead?

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:48.610
Hold onto me!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:35.480
Kakyoin!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:37.220
Jump!

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:43.050
Outside!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:46.630
Please go on ahead!

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:52.410
Ma'am!

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:52.870
Quickly!

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.500
Ahh...ah...yes...

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:56.970
Th...

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:59.740
Thank you so much.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.260
What's going on?

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.200
That woman, N-Yah...is the Stand user.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:19.770
She controls the fog.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.530
Through the slightest wound inflicted....

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.300
...you can be controlled just like them.

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:25.770
As a matter of fact...

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.670
I'm already affected.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.040
I don't know when I'll be controlled.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:33.850
On top of that...

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.450
she forced me to lick the toilet bowl!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.280
That bitch...unforgivable!

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:41.790
In any case, we have to find that
woman as soon as possible...

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.850
But, with all this going on...

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:47.690
the town is overflowing with dead people!

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:50.660
What!?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.390
The grand entrance.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.070
Polnareff!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.720
Emerald Splash!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:54.820
Shit!

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.580
We've been waiting for you, Avdol!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.820
My apologies...for being late!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:04.890
Your injuries...

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.330
are you all right?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.450
Polnareff...

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.320
I'll explain later!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.490
Is it invincible...?

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.370
We need to hit the main body...

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.510
or this will go on forever!

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:01.320
N-Yah...

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.760
she must be watching us from
somewhere inside that hotel, laughing.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.730
Avdol...

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.740
Sorry, but could you give me a light?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.250
Avdol, the light!

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:32.310
Oh... Yes...

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.840
In the short time since I saw you last...

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:59.810
you've aged quite a bit...

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:00.710
N-Yah.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.150
N-Yah...?

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.110
It can't be. This old woman...

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.980
is a Stand user?

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:08.720
Hey!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:10.790
N-Yah is a young woman...

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.050
not an old lady!

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:14.090
And you know that, don't you?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.400
Through the battles in the past...

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:26.100
I've found a way to spot the common
characteristic in all Stand users.

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:35.810
When a Stand user inhales cigarette
smoke, even a small amount...

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.540
a vein in the nose surfaces.

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:42.390
You're kidding, Jotaro!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:43.520
Yeah, I'm kidding.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:50.890
But...

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.020
we found the idiot, didn't we?

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:02.640
N-Yah always had her left hand hidden.

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:06.470
Your son also had a right
hand in place of his left hand.

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:11.070
If you're his mother, and are that woman...

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.680
your left hand is also...

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.690
a right hand...!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:22.620
Polnareff!

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:45.810
Jotaro!

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:47.740
No!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:56.720
<i> R-run, Jotaro! </i>

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.700
<i> You'll get a hole in your leg! </i>

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.770
<i> When that happens, you're finished! </i>

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:10.080
"lf you don't watch your feet,
you may end up falling."

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:13.770
You fell into my trap...

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:14.780
Jotaro!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.780
What a pain.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:35.290
I'm not letting you use
Polnareff as a toy any longer.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.000
One more time...

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:43.040
Before you breathe one more
time, I'll finish that Stand.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:47.940
One more time <i>what,</i> you say?

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.140
You scumbags who murdered my son!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:52.420
One ti...!

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:53.090
One...!

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:54.320
One...!

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:12.870
What?

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:16.370
Star Platinum is sucking in Justice's head!?

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:29.180
I see...

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.220
Polnareff!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:06.950
Sorry, everyone!

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:09.460
Just because I was careless, I
dragged all of you down! Damn it!

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:10.720
That woman...come to think of it...

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.660
I should've known that something
was wrong with her! Right!?

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:13.990
Like, hiding her left hand like that...

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:15.500
who'd have thought that
old hag was disguised...

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:16.470
But, Avdol...!

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.330
Why are you...?

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:18.400
What's going on here?

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:20.700
When it happened, I'm sure
Hol Horse's bullet hit your...

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.340
Yes, I did get shot.

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:24.940
Right here on the forehead.

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:27.710
But at that moment...

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.980
J. Gail stabbed me.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.680
I jerked backwards...

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.490
and was not fatally wounded.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:39.520
I'm so glad...!

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:43.660
Avdol...

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:45.660
that you're alive.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:50.670
You're alive...!

00:20:58.880 --> 00:20:59.900
This old woman...

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:00.910
what should we do with her?

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:05.180
I have millions of questions
about Dio that need to be asked.

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:09.480
When did you start
suspecting this old woman?

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:13.150
From the moment this
old woman showed up.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.850
From the very beginning?

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:15.890
Yeah...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:21.270
She was just way too normal to be
hanging around those strange guys.

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:25.460
By the way...

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:28.400
how did you find out
where we were, Avdol?

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:32.910
Ah...Mr. Joestar phoned me this morning.

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:34.240
Phoned...?

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:34.900
Ah!

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:37.410
That time...

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:40.350
Wait a minute!

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:41.220
Hey!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:45.290
Then...that means Mr. Joestar knew
that you've been alive all this time?

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.490
In India, I was tended to...

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:51.530
by Mr. Joestar and Jotaro.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:52.390
Eh!?

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:55.830
You guys already knew, in India,
that Avdol was alive, but...

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:58.170
you didn't tell me about it!?

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.540
Polnareff sure has a loose tongue.

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:01.500
Yeah.

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:04.040
If you carelessly blurted it out...

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:07.710
I thought Avdol-san won't be able to
recover from his injuries in peace...

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:09.370
so I made the suggestion.

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:11.570
Damn it!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:14.520
So I'm the only one left out, damn it!

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:21.650
Lord Dio...!

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:22.230
Th...

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:24.730
This is...!

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:26.730
Old woman!

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:31.240
A Bud of Flesh!

00:22:31.510 --> 00:22:32.560
Chariot!

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:38.870
Old woman!

00:22:39.010 --> 00:22:39.840
Dio's...

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:42.180
Tell me the true nature of Dio's Stand!

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:46.810
Tell me!

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:49.050
You've been betrayed by Dio!

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:51.280
That guy...

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:54.120
he's not the kind of man you think he is!

00:22:57.160 --> 00:22:57.650
I beg you!

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:02.700
Ju...

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:05.600
Just once...

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:08.670
I will tell you...

00:23:09.310 --> 00:23:11.610
Lord Dio's...

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:13.110
Stand...

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:15.420
Try asking <i>it!</i>

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:29.690
Shit...!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:35.930
Dio never allows anyone in his heart, ever...

00:24:40.730 --> 00:24:42.330
It's disappearing...

00:24:42.870 --> 00:24:46.240
The town itself was a Stand.

00:24:48.710 --> 00:24:50.970
That takes care of the burial.

00:24:59.150 --> 00:25:01.490
She was a formidable enemy.

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:13.090
Hey...

00:25:13.230 --> 00:25:15.220
isn't that Hol Horse over there?

00:25:23.210 --> 00:25:24.870
He's still breathing.

00:25:25.010 --> 00:25:26.270
Leave him alone!

00:25:26.410 --> 00:25:27.780
He needs to be hospitalized.

00:25:27.920 --> 00:25:30.410
He won't be able to pursue us any more.

00:25:50.340 --> 00:25:51.860
Holley...

00:25:53.270 --> 00:25:54.600
Let's go!

00:25:54.740 --> 00:25:56.210
After crossing this desert...

00:25:56.340 --> 00:25:58.370
we'll finally be in Egypt!

00:26:12.090 --> 00:26:13.120
Dio...!
